  "_about": "Recipes for crafting skills (cooking). `rank`: the skill rank needed to make it. `skillUp`: the ranks at which it turns yellow, green and grey: below yellow (orange) every craft raises the skill, yellow most of the time, green now and then, grey never (WoW). `inputs` are used up, `output` is made. `station`: what must be close by (`fire`: a camp or a hearth; `forge`: a forge, for Smithing; `workbench`: a workbench, for Woodcraft; `knife`: a skinning knife on your tool belt, anywhere (Hunting's filleting); `alchemy`: an alchemy bench). `trainer` and `cost`: who teaches it, for how many coins; a recipe without a trainer comes with the skill.",
